        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/a8b319/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-11-02T22:28:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi guys. &nbsp;Not sure if this is the correct place to ask, but you have all been so helpful, thought I would give it a try.</p><p>i know I will be moving next June (2016) and so I would like to change my shipping address for my Kickstarter copy of the game. &nbsp;I know &gt;G doesn't use pledge manager, so I am just not sure what to do.</p><p>i am very inexperienced with Kickstarter in general, so if anyone knows if I should be doing it through KS let me know!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:45.308Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
