        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi guys. &nbsp;Not sure if this is the correct place to ask, but you have all been so helpful, thought I would give it a try.</p><p>i know I will be moving next June (2016) and so I would like to change my shipping address for my Kickstarter copy of the game. &nbsp;I know &gt;G doesn&#39;t use pledge manager, so I am just not sure what to do.</p><p>i am very inexperienced with Kickstarter in general, so if anyone knows if I should be doing it through KS let me know!</p>",
