        "raw": "<p>&gt;G will be sending out a survey at some point to clarify exactly which reward you want. That&#39;s your first chance to give an address. After that, in the past, the way to update your address is to e-mail them directly, and they will update it in their system. They&#39;ll also send out a reminder e-mail a couple of weeks before they actually start shipping, just to remind you to give an updated address then. (Or, at least, that&#39;s what they&#39;ve done on previous recent Kickstarter/preorder campaigns.)</p>",
